  "blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "serving-layers",
      "block_type": "TABLE",
      "text": "同じ「support」でも、動かしている層が違う。\nFull serving framework：vLLM v0.27.0はKimi K3のfull-stack support、新しいmodel integration、PyTorch/Triton upgrade、KV/offload・disaggregation・serving機能をまとめて扱う。\nLocal inference runtime：llama.cpp b10369はPocket-TTS supportとconvolution-to-GEMM実装を追加する。\nFront-end / cache behavior：SGLang v0.5.17はRust server front end、session-aware radix caching、serving/runtime変更を記述する。\nLow-level kernel：FlashInfer v0.6.17はMoE expert parallelism、SM12x FP4 fixes、unified MXFP4 APIs、decode coverageを記述する。",
      "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
      "evidence_refs": [
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:60255c39b9f87212","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-vllm-project-vllm-v0-27-0","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:6e624289e3689101","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-ggml-org-llama-cpp-b10369","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:02b041c3a0c539b4","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-sgl-project-sglang-v0-5-17","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:e5d17ec955c40750","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-flashinfer-ai-flashinfer-v0-6-17","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "serving-chain",
      "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "text": "この四層を分けると、availabilityがruntime supportに依存する理由が見える。full-stack側ではvLLMがモデル統合とserving機能を一つの更新に束ね、SGLangはday-zero servingとfront end/cacheの側から同じ運用面を支える。FlashInferはその下でdecodeや低レベルの実行を担い、llama.cppはlocal runtimeで別の利用面を開く。つまり、モデルを取得できることと、選んだ環境で継続的に運用できることは同じ条件ではない。",
      "attribution_mode": "MIXED",
      "evidence_refs": [
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:60255c39b9f87212","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-vllm-project-vllm-v0-27-0","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:02b041c3a0c539b4","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-sgl-project-sglang-v0-5-17","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:e5d17ec955c40750","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-flashinfer-ai-flashinfer-v0-6-17","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:6e624289e3689101","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-ggml-org-llama-cpp-b10369","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "serving-attribution",
      "block_type": "CLAIM_BOUNDARY",
      "text": "ただし、release notesにある機能追加と性能改善を同じ強さの事実として読んではいけない。とくにllama.cppのtiming figuresはproject-reportedとして扱い、vLLM、SGLang、FlashInferのperformanceをここで独立測定結果へ拡張しない。今回の比較軸は「何層が変わったか」であり、数値の横比較ではない。",
      "attribution_mode": "MIXED",
