        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:02b041c3a0c539b4","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-sgl-project-sglang-v0-5-17","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},
        {"evidence_task_id":"evidence:2026-W33:e5d17ec955c40750","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1","subject_id":"entity:w33:base-github-release-flashinfer-ai-flashinfer-v0-6-17","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "serving-reader-question",
      "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "text": "読者が次にモデルのavailabilityを見るときは、「モデルを持っているか」だけでなく、どのserving frameworkが統合し、どのlocal runtimeが動かし、front end/cacheが状態を扱い、kernel層がdecodeを支えるのかを問いたい。releaseを四本のニュースに分けず、実運用へ変換する層の連鎖として読むことで、モデル競争の裏側にある実装競争が見えてくる。",
